      "headline": "50代女性がはしか感染 スーパー2店舗を利用したとして県が注意を呼びかけ 愛媛",
      "headlineTranslated": "A woman in her 50s contracted measles; Ehime Prefecture warns after she used two supermarkets.",
      "summary": "Measles confirmed in Ehime Prefecture: A woman in her 50s living in the Chūyō Health Center jurisdiction has tested positive, marking Ehime’s third measles case this year. Illness began with fever, sore throat and a rash around Oct 20; she sought care in Matsuyama on Oct 22, with genetic testing confirming measles on Oct 23. She had one prior measles vaccination and no overseas travel history. She visited two Matsuyama supermarkets on Oct 19 and Oct 21, prompting the prefecture to advise customers who shopped there on those dates to monitor for symptoms. Nationwide, measles cases reached 579 this year. The article does not specify an infection source and does not indicate importation/exportation details.",
